  "title": "Hartevo Hightouch reverse-ETL sync result Layer-1 contract",
  "description": "Bounded Hightouch workspace, source, model, sync, destination, and run metadata for a Mission proposal; never a sync effect, source-row, destination-write, or Outcome authority.",
